Connects \(n+1\) samples \((x_k,y_k)\), \(y_k=f(x_k)\), of \(f\) on \([a,b]\) with straight segments (linear),
\[
L(x) = y_k + \frac{y_{k+1}-y_k}{x_{k+1}-x_k}\,(x-x_k),\qquad x\in[x_k,x_{k+1}],
